#5204
A Road Through The Hills~
   The road widens here into a large circular lot, as the northern caravan
trail through the desert meets this lane that comes straight out of the hills
to the south. A few empty, broken crates litter the ground here, perhaps
evidence of an accident, or a past enchange of goods between those who dwell
in the mountains and those who live on the coast and in the desert.
   Hills and fields span to the eastern and western horizons, while the road
continues north and south.
~
