#5249
A Rocky Slope~
   You work your way through the rocky terrain which at times is quite
unforgiving. To the east, a wooden fence surrounds a small field of wheat
and beyond that, the large walls of a city dominate the horizon.
   The gradient to the south is now extreme and you won't be able to travel
in that direction. It's amazing that the small farming community and city
to the east has been able to survive with the dropping temperature and
thin air up here.
~
