#5254
A Mountain Road~
   You stand on a steep road, surrounded by tall pines. The view from here is
lovely, and to the north, you look out over the desert across the horizon.
Mossy rocks lie to either side of the road, their green faces showing which
way is north, while lichens point out the western direction of the mountains.
   The road descends into the lower elevations to the north, and climbs high
into the clouds to the south. With a bit of scrambling, you might be able to
climb the hills to the east.
~
