#5274
A Mountainous Trail~
   You stand on a rock-strewn road that ascends the icy mountain below above
you. The air is growing thin, and your breath is starting to become labored.
   The road ascends to the south, and descends to the north. You could also
probably scramble up a slight rise to the east.
